OpenLambda

Collection and alignment components, hardware illustrations, and example videos
are adapted from EgoHumanoid-V2 (https://opendrivelab.com/EgoHumanoid-V2/).
The human-reference alignment implementation adapts the geometric correction
method from EgoAlign (https://lambdahumanoid.github.io/EgoAlign/).
OpenLambda modifies and integrates these components into its action-alignment
pipeline. Assets and third-party components retain their owners' rights and
original terms. SONIC runtime code and model assets are obtained separately;
their upstream notices and licenses continue to apply.
